:[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"keyboardShortcut"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"_"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"key"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"KeyEquivalent","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/KeyEquivalent","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI13KeyEquivalentV"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"modifiers"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"EventModifiers","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/EventModifiers","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI14EventModifiersV"},{"kind":"text","text":" = .command, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"localization"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"KeyboardShortcut","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/KeyboardShortcut","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI16KeyboardShortcutV"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Localization","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/KeyboardShortcut\/Localization-swift.struct","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI16KeyboardShortcutV12LocalizationV"},{"kind":"text","text":" = .automatic) -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Scene","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP"},{"kind":"text","text":"\n"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"key","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The key equivalent the user presses to present the scene.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"modifiers","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The modifier keys required to perform the shortcut."}]}]},{"name":"localization","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The localization style to apply to the shortcut."}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"anchor":"return-value","text":"Return Value","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A scene that can be presented with a keyboard shortcut."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A scene’s keyboard shortcut is bound to the command it adds for creating"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"new windows (in the case of "},{"code":"WindowGroup","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":"DocumentGroup","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":") or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"bringing a singleton window forward (in the case of "},{"code":"Window","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and, on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"macOS, "},{"code":"Settings","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"). Pressing the keyboard shortcut is equivalent to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"selecting the menu command."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In cases where a command already has a keyboard shortcut, the scene’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keyboard shortcut is used instead. For example, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"WindowGroup"},{"type":"text","text":" normally"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"creates a File > New Window menu command whose keyboard shortcut is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"⌘N"},{"type":"text","text":". The following code changes it to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"⌥⌘N"},{"type":"text","text":":"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["WindowGroup {","    ContentView()","}",".keyboardShortcut(\"n\", modifiers: [.option, .command])"],"syntax":null,"type":"codeListing"},{"text":"Localization","anchor":"Localization","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Provide a ","type":"text"},{"code":"localization","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" value to specify how this shortcut","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"should be localized.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Given that "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"key"},{"type":"text","text":" is always defined in relation to the US-English"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keyboard layout, it might be hard to reach on different international"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"layouts. For example the shortcut "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"⌘["},{"type":"text","text":" works well for the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"US layout but is hard to reach for German users, where"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"["},{"type":"text","text":" is available by pressing "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"⌥5"},{"type":"text","text":", making users type "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"⌥⌘5"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The automatic keyboard shortcut remapping re-assigns the shortcut to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"an appropriate replacement, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"⌘Ö"},{"type":"text","text":" in this case."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Providing the option"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/KeyboardShortcut\/Localization-swift.struct\/custom"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"disables the automatic localization for this shortcut to tell the system"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that internationalization is taken care of in a different way."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,